# Party banter: two professionals, one datum.
dialogue TSC_Banter_TracksAge

== start ==
_You overhear Bran and Maewyn reading the same ground._

Bran: Tracks by the stream. Two days old. Maybe three.

Maewyn: Two.

Bran: Two, then.

Maewyn: You were close.

Bran: That's the warmest thing you've said all week.

* [Leave them to it.] -> end
